GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_ReleaseGovernance> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_ReleaseGovernance> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#ReleaseGovernance> ;
    narr:childCount "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "808905fc06fb25ea765659d1425c23e29830364a" ;
    narr:narration """This hub covers the release governance rule established for Meridian deployments as of 20260718. The policy originates in a concrete incident: [two unsigned artifacts reached staging last quarter](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2), which Quinton Fairweather cited as the direct cause for introducing a gate. The settled rule, as declared by Fairweather and restated in session summary, is that [a signed release manifest is required before any Meridian deploy ships](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1). The session crystallized three conclusions: [the gate itself](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3), [its scope covering staging and production](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4), and [ownership assigned to Quinton Fairweather](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5). The broader narrative node frames this as a trajectory [from unsigned artifacts to cryptographically gated releases](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedManifestGate). The register throughout is matter-of-fact and authority-ranking; no dissent or alternative framing appears in the children.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedManifestGate> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The incident evidence (two unsigned artifacts, last quarter) is asserted by Fairweather without corroborating detail — the causal link between that specific failure and the gate's design is stated, not demonstrated; a reader probing the sufficiency of that justification finds no counter-argument here." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Scope is declared as staging and production, leaving open whether development or other pre-staging environments are excluded by design or by omission — the children do not address this boundary." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedFallbackProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:writer "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6" .
}